:: win WW [autosave] {"position":"300,2400","size":"100,100"}
You killed the white wolf and won the battle, gaining <<print ($mobLvl*2 + $mobXP).toFixed(0)>> XP and $mobCoins Coins<<if $lootchance lte 45>> and Wolf meat.<<elseif $lootchance lte 75>> and Wolf fur.<<elseif $lootchance lte 100>>.<</if>>
<<EventCurrencies>>\
<<link "Go back">>
<<goto $lastVisitedPassage>>
	<<if $lootchance lte 45>>
		<<set $wolfMeat += 1>>
	<<elseif $lootchance lte 75>>
    	<<set $wolfFur += 1>>
	<</if>>
<<set $killedWW += 1>>
<<MobRewards>>
<</link>>


